{"unit_id":"BaqiF2__dsh-plugin-precheck#card-zh","repo":"BaqiF2/dsh-plugin-precheck","commit":"5de0e34c7d7c199b3ce8566d7e1efb91fb27e9e4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-precheck 是面向 DSH Web 的插件安装预检助手，在设置页提供安装前检查界面，并可接入 dsh-market 的安装和更新操作。它解析并锁定插件版本，核对 Node.js 与 peerDependencies 兼容性，比较配置补丁和现有配置树，再在临时 profile 中试装、校验配置并试启动。检查通过后可按已验证的版本正式安装；安装前会备份 profile 文件，失败时尝试恢复并显示诊断报告。适合希望在安装 DSH 插件前了解兼容情况并验证启动的 Web 用户。运行需要 Node.js 22 或更高版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:110-125","lib/pipeline.js:194-235","lib/pipeline.js:264-275","lib/install.js:44-75"]}
{"unit_id":"BaqiF2__dsh-plugin-precheck#card-en","repo":"BaqiF2/dsh-plugin-precheck","commit":"5de0e34c7d7c199b3ce8566d7e1efb91fb27e9e4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-precheck checks DSH Web plugins before installation. It locks a version, checks dependencies and configuration patches, then trials the plugin in a temporary profile. After a pass, it installs that version and can restore backed-up files if installation fails. Requires Node.js 22+.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:110-125","lib/pipeline.js:194-235","lib/pipeline.js:264-275","lib/install.js:44-75"]}
